The B91 PSPI/DMA LED strip code derives from the Apache-2.0 WS2812 driver
by scholzri (Rainy 75 ZMK) and its 154-LED Crush 80 adaptation by Ritwick
Verma. The upstream version used for this port is:

https://github.com/RitwickVerma/Crush80_ZMK/tree/36ad482/zmk/drivers/led_strip
https://github.com/scholzri/rainy75-zmk

See LICENSE in this directory for the license for the ported driver.
